"absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="8"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="Two golfers walking side by side down a wide fairway at sunrise" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 1024px) 50vw, 100vw" src="/images/golf-members.jpg" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:center 60%;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-col justify-between gap-12 lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 lg:py-4"><div><p class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-bone/60">Private events</p><h3 class="mt-5 text-[clamp(2rem,3.6vw,3.4rem)] font-light leading-[1.04] tracking-[-0.03em]">Your event, <em class="font-serif font-normal">on our land.</em></h3><p class="mt-6 max-w-md text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-bone/70" data-reveal="true">From a golf day for forty to a wedding for two hundred, the Pavilion, the Terrace and the course itself are yours to shape. Our events team handles everything from the tee sheet to the last dance.</p></div><dl class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-4 border-t border-bone/15 pt-8"><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">guests seated in the Pavilion</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="240" data-decimals="0">240</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">holes for a shotgun start</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="18" data-decimals="0">18</span></span></dd></div><div class="flex flex-col-reverse" data-reveal="true"><dt class="mt-2 text-xs leading-snug text-bone/60 sm:text-sm">lodges for overnight guests</dt><dd class="type-wide text-[clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.8rem)] font-light leading-none tracking-[-0.03em]"><span><span class="tabular-nums" data-count="24" data-decimals="0">24</span></span></dd></div></dl><button class="inline-flex h-12 w-fit items-center gap-3 rounded-full bg-bone px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal transition-colors hover:bg-ochre" data-reveal="true" type="button">Plan an event<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></div></section><section aria-labelledby="hosting-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-bone text-charcoal" id="hosting"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">03</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Hosting at Morrow</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em]" id="hosting-heading">Three ways to <em class="font-serif font-normal">make it yours.</em></h2></div><p class="self-end text-base leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70 lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9" data-reveal="true">Tell us the shape of your day and our events team will return a plan, a menu and a tee sheet within a week.</p></div><ul class="mt-14 grid gap-12 md:grid-cols-3 md:gap-6 lg:mt-20 lg:gap-8"><li class="flex flex-col md:odd:mt-0 md:even:mt-16"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="A flagstick on an immaculate green above the bay as the sun sets behind the mountains" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/green-at-sunset.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:80% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col" data-reveal="true"><p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-charcoal/50">01</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-2xl font-medium uppercase">Golf days</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">The Championship 18 reserved for your group, a format of your choosing and a long dinner in the Pavilion to finish.</p><ul class="mt-6 border-t border-charcoal/10"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">24 to 80 players</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Shotgun or tee times</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Prize giving on the Terrace</li></ul><div class="mt-8"><button aria-label="Plan golf days" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-charcoal/20 text-charcoal hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Plan this<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></li><li class="flex flex-col md:odd:mt-0 md:even:mt-16"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="The clubhouse terrace on the cliff edge, with coastal fairways stretching along the sea below" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/cliff-terrace.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col" data-reveal="true"><p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-charcoal/50">02</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-2xl font-medium uppercase">Weddings</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Vows on the cliff above the coast holes, dinner under the timber canopy and the lodges for everyone who stays.</p><ul class="mt-6 border-t border-charcoal/10"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Up to 200 guests</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Ceremony on the cliff</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Lodges for the wedding party</li></ul><div class="mt-8"><button aria-label="Plan weddings" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-charcoal/20 text-charcoal hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Plan this<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></li><li class="flex flex-col md:odd:mt-0 md:even:mt-16"><div class="relative overflow-hidden bg-sand aspect-[4/5] rounded-[4px]" data-mask="up"><div class="absolute inset-x-0 -top-[14%] -bottom-[14%]" data-parallax="6"><div class="relative h-full w-full" data-mask-inner=""><img alt="The modern clubhouse with its long flat roof and glowing glass, a row of carts and an olive tree in front" class="object-cover" data-nimg="fill" decoding="async" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 768px) 33vw, 100vw" src="/images/campaign/clubhouse-carts.png" style="position:absolute;height:100%;width:100%;left:0;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;object-position:30% center;color:transparent"/></div></div></div><div class="flex flex-1 flex-col" data-reveal="true"><p class="mt-6 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-charcoal/50">03</p><h3 class="type-wide mt-3 text-2xl font-medium uppercase">Retreats</h3><p class="mt-3 text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Quiet rooms for thinking, a course for talking and a table for deciding. Two to four days on the estate.</p><ul class="mt-6 border-t border-charcoal/10"><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">12 to 60 guests</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">The Map Room and Pavilion</li><li class="border-b border-charcoal/10 py-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-charcoal/70">Coaching sessions included</li></ul><div class="mt-8"><button aria-label="Plan retreats" class="inline-flex h-12 items-center gap-3 rounded-full px-6 text-[12px] font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.16em] transition-colors duration-300 border border-charcoal/20 text-charcoal hover:border-charcoal hover:bg-charcoal hover:text-bone" type="button">Plan this<svg aria-hidden="true" class="lucide lucide-arrow-up-right size-4" fill="none" height="24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" viewbox="0 0 24 24" width="24" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"><path d="M7 7h10v10"></path><path d="M7 17 17 7"></path></svg></button></div></div></li></ul></div></section><section aria-labelledby="golf-days-heading" class="relative z-10 bg-sand text-charcoal" id="golf-days"><div class="px-5 py-24 sm:px-8 lg:px-12 lg:py-32"><div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-8"><div class="lg:col-span-7"><p class="flex items-center gap-3 font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.24em] text-charcoal/70"><span class="tabular-nums">04</span><span aria-hidden="true" class="h-px w-8 bg-current opacity-40"></span><span>Golf days</span></p><h2 class="mt-6 text-[clamp(2.1rem,4.2vw,4.2rem)] font-light leading-[1.02] tracking-[-0.03em] [&amp;_em]:font-serif [&amp;_em]:font-normal" id="golf-days-heading">What a golf day <em>includes.</em></h2></div><p class="self-end text-base leading-relaxed lg:col-span-4 lg:col-start-9 text-charcoal/70" data-reveal="true">Everything below is part of every golf day at Morrow. The only choice left is the format.</p></div><ol class="mt-14 grid gap-x-8 gap-y-12 lg:mt-20 sm:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3"><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">01</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Shotgun start</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">All eighteen holes held for your group, with starters, marshals and forecaddies if you want them.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">02</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Your format</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Scramble, Stableford or match play, set up and scored by our team from the first tee.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">03</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Live scoring</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Scores entered on the carts appear on the leaderboard in the Pavilion as the day unfolds.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">04</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Hospitality</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Breakfast before, the Halfway House at the turn and dinner in the Pavilion once the cards are in.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">05</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Prize giving</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">Trophies, nearest the pin and longest drive, presented on the Terrace as the sun goes down.</p></li><li class="flex flex-col border-t pt-6 border-charcoal/15" data-reveal="true"><span class="font-mono text-[11px] tabular-nums text-charcoal/45">06</span><h3 class="type-wide text-[17px] font-medium uppercase leading-snug tracking-[0.02em] mt-5">Overnight</h3><p class="mt-3 max-w-sm text-[15px] leading-relaxed text-charcoal/70">The lodges held for your guests at event rates, with breakfast and a morning nine for early risers.</p></li></ol></div></section><section aria-label="Next page" class="relative z-10 bg-charcoal"><a class="group relative block h-[78svh] min-h-[440px] ov